export const takeClockSources=[['game','게임 시간'],['unscaled','배율 무시'],['platform','플랫폼 시계']];
export const takeClockMaxStart=Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER-240*86400;
const validRate=fps=>Number.isInteger(fps)&&fps>=1&&fps<=240;
export function resolveTakeRate(value){if(validRate(value))return {numerator:value,denominator:1};if(!value||typeof value!=='object'||Array.isArray(value)||Object.keys(value).length!==2||!Object.hasOwn(value,'numerator')||!Object.hasOwn(value,'denominator'))throw Error('녹화 FPS 분자·분모를 확인하세요.');let {numerator,denominator}=value;if(![numerator,denominator].every(v=>Number.isInteger(v)&&v>0&&v<=2147483647)||numerator<denominator||numerator>240*denominator)throw Error('녹화 FPS는 1~240 사이의 양의 분수여야 해요.');let a=numerator,b=denominator;while(b){const r=a%b;a=b;b=r;}return {numerator:numerator/a,denominator:denominator/a};}
export function takeRateAllowsDrop(value){const r=resolveTakeRate(value);return r.denominator===1001&&(r.numerator===30000||r.numerator===60000);}
export function resolveTakeClock(value){if(value===undefined)return {version:1,source:'game',startFrame:0};if(!value||typeof value!=='object'||Array.isArray(value)||Object.keys(value).some(k=>!['version','source','startFrame','rate','dropFrame'].includes(k)))throw Error('녹화 시계 설정을 확인하세요.');const clock={version:1,source:'game',startFrame:0,...value};if(clock.version!==1||!takeClockSources.some(([key])=>key===clock.source)||!Number.isSafeInteger(clock.startFrame)||clock.startFrame<0||clock.startFrame>takeClockMaxStart)throw Error('녹화 시간 기준·시작 프레임을 확인하세요.');if(Object.hasOwn(clock,'rate')){if(!clock.rate||typeof clock.rate!=='object')throw Error('녹화 FPS는 분자·분모 쌍으로 지정하세요.');clock.rate=resolveTakeRate(clock.rate);}if(Object.hasOwn(clock,'dropFrame')&&typeof clock.dropFrame!=='boolean'||clock.dropFrame&&(!clock.rate||!takeRateAllowsDrop(clock.rate)))throw Error('드롭 프레임 표기는 30000/1001 또는 60000/1001 FPS에서만 사용할 수 있어요.');return clock;}
export function validTakeClock(value){try{return value?.version===1&&!!resolveTakeClock(value);}catch{return false;}}
export function takeSampleIndex(time,rate){if(!Number.isFinite(time)||time<0||time>86400)throw Error('녹화 시간을 확인하세요.');const scaled=time*rate.numerator/rate.denominator;return Math.floor(scaled+4*Number.EPSILON*Math.max(1,scaled));}
export function takeTimecodeFrame(clock,time,fps){const settings=resolveTakeClock(clock);return settings.startFrame+takeSampleIndex(time,resolveTakeRate(settings.rate??fps));}
function timecodeRate(value,dropFrame){const rational=resolveTakeRate(value);if(typeof dropFrame!=='boolean'||dropFrame&&!takeRateAllowsDrop(rational))throw Error('타임코드 드롭 프레임 설정을 확인하세요.');const nominal=Math.round(rational.numerator/rational.denominator);return {nominal:BigInt(nominal),drop:dropFrame?BigInt(nominal/15):0n};}
export function formatTakeTimecode(frame,fps,{dropFrame=false}={}){if(!Number.isSafeInteger(frame)||frame<0)throw Error('타임코드 프레임을 확인하세요.');const {nominal:rate,drop}=timecodeRate(fps,dropFrame);let f=BigInt(frame);if(drop){const ten=rate*600n-drop*9n,remainder=f%ten;f+=drop*9n*(f/ten)+(remainder>=drop?drop*((remainder-drop)/(rate*60n-drop)):0n);}const seconds=f/rate,days=seconds/86400n,pad=v=>String(v).padStart(2,'0');return (days?days+'d ':'')+[pad(seconds/3600n%24n),pad(seconds/60n%60n),pad(seconds%60n)].join(':')+(drop?';':':')+pad(f%rate);}
export function parseTakeTimecode(text,fps,{dropFrame=false}={}){if(typeof text!=='string'||text.length>64)throw Error('타임코드를 확인하세요.');const {nominal:rate,drop}=timecodeRate(fps,dropFrame),m=/^(?:(\d+)d )?(\d{2}):(\d{2}):(\d{2})([:;])(\d{2,3})$/.exec(text.trim());if(!m||Number(m[2])>=24||Number(m[3])>=60||Number(m[4])>=60||BigInt(m[6])>=rate||m[5]!== (drop?';':':')||drop&&Number(m[3])%10!==0&&Number(m[4])===0&&BigInt(m[6])<drop)throw Error(drop?'타임코드는 유효한 HH:MM:SS;FF로 입력하세요.':'타임코드는 HH:MM:SS:FF로 입력하세요.');const minutes=(BigInt(m[1]||0)*24n+BigInt(m[2]))*60n+BigInt(m[3]),f=(minutes*60n+BigInt(m[4]))*rate+BigInt(m[6])-drop*(minutes-minutes/10n);if(f>BigInt(takeClockMaxStart))throw Error('시작 타임코드 범위를 확인하세요.');return Number(f);}
export class TakeClock {
 constructor(settings,now=()=>performance.now()){const copy=resolveTakeClock(settings);if(copy.rate)Object.freeze(copy.rate);this.settings=Object.freeze(copy);this.now=now;this.compensation=0;this.last=0;if(this.settings.source==='platform'){const epoch=now();if(!Number.isFinite(epoch))throw Error('플랫폼 시계를 읽을 수 없어요.');this.epoch=this.previousNow=epoch;}}
 advance(current,delta,unscaled=delta){if(!Number.isFinite(delta)||delta<0||!Number.isFinite(unscaled)||unscaled<0)throw Error('녹화 프레임 시간을 확인하세요.');let next;if(this.settings.source==='platform'){const now=this.now();if(!Number.isFinite(now)||now<this.previousNow)throw Error('플랫폼 시계가 역행했어요.');this.previousNow=now;next=(now-this.epoch)/1000;}else{const step=this.settings.source==='unscaled'?unscaled:delta;if(!step)return current;if(this.last!==current)this.compensation=0;const adjusted=step-this.compensation;next=current+adjusted;this.compensation=(next-current)-adjusted;this.last=next;}if(!Number.isFinite(next)||next<current||next>86400)throw Error('녹화 시계 범위를 확인하세요.');return next;}
}
export const takeClockContract={field:'clock / sequence.recordingClock',shape:'{version:1,source:game|unscaled|platform,startFrame:nonnegative safe integer,rate?:{numerator,denominator},dropFrame?:boolean}',rate:'Reduced positive int32 rational, 1..240 FPS; omitted follows integer sequence.fps. Actual capture cadence and timecode use rate; sequence.fps stays the legacy integer base; displayRate independently selects a rational editing grid. A partial runtime override replaces the whole rate pair and preserves other clock fields; incompatible inherited dropFrame requires explicit false.',sampling:'Epoch-anchored frame index; at most one real completed pose per call, no fabricated catch-up frames. Skipped intervals are not relabeled as captured frames.',sources:{game:'scaled completed world tick, editor pause freezes',unscaled:'completed unscaled world tick, editor pause freezes',platform:'monotonic performance clock since Take start; ignores scale/pause, samples frozen pose on existing editor frames when paused; unavailable during a blocked frame'},timecode:'NDF uses nearest integer nominal FPS and HH:MM:SS:FF; DF only exact 30000/1001 or 60000/1001 uses HH:MM:SS;FF, skips 2/4 labels each minute except multiples of ten, never drops captured poses. Optional days, safe frame origin; keys remain relative seconds.',remaining:['Audio/PCM/external/genlock/timecode providers','Platform sampling while the UI thread is suspended']};
